<body data-time="present">
  <header class="site"><div class="wrap bar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">Tri<b>plicity</b></a>
    <nav class="navlinks" id="navlinks"><a href="#who">Who it is for</a><a href="#how">How it works</a><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start a conversation</a></nav><button class="navtoggle" type="button" aria-label="Open menu" aria-controls="navlinks" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </div></header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1622675363311-3e1904dc1885?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A leadership team in conversation around a table" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="veil"></div>
      <div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="timeword"><span class="tw past">Past</span><span class="tw present on">Present</span><span class="tw future">Future</span></div>
        <h1>Coaching for executives, leaders <em>and their teams.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Triplicity is executive leadership, communication and high-performance coaching. Russ works with you and your leaders, in private sessions and as a team, for a season or a year.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start a conversation</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="guarantee">Thirty-minute call. We tell you if it fits.</p>
      </div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="split" id="problem"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1630487656049-6db93a53a7e9?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="A team leaning in over the work on a table"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Your best people are carrying the most, with the least support.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li>Executives get feedback last and need it most.</li><li>Teams know what to do and still cannot say it to each other.</li><li>The offsite high is gone by Tuesday.</li></ul>
    </div></section>

    <section class="split rev alt" id="approach"><div class="split__media" style="background-image:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758873268933-e0765262e58d?w=1400&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop');background-position:center" role="img" aria-label="A team putting their hands together"></div><div class="split__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we coach</p><h2>One coach. In the room. All season.</h2>
      <ul class="ticks"><li><b>Executive leadership</b>: private 60-minute sessions, three a month, on what is actually on your desk.</li><li><b>Leadership and team coaching</b>: a group of six, a coach who sees the room, and the conversations that fix it.</li><li><b>Communication coaching</b>: say the hard thing well, and listen so people tell you the truth.</li><li><b>High performance</b>: the daily habits that keep a leader clear, steady and present.</li></ul>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start a conversation</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="who"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Who it is for</p><h2>Three ways in.</h2></div>
      <div class="pcards"><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577415124269-fc1140a69e91?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two executives talking through a decision" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">One leader</span><b>The executive</b><em>You run the company. You need one person who tells you the truth and helps you act on it.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573164574511-73c773193279?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A leadership team meeting around a conference table" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">One team</span><b>The leadership team</b><em>Six people who make decisions together, coached together, so the meeting after the meeting ends.</em></div><div class="pcard"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542323228-002ac256e7b8?w=900&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Men and women on a team stacking their hands together" loading="lazy" /><span class="pc-k">One company</span><b>The organization</b><em>Coaching for leaders at every level of the company.</em></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec gallery-sec" id="what"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What we coach</p><h2>Five things every leader needs.</h2></div><div class="gallery five"><figure><img src="/img/russ/russ-sideline-2.jpg" alt="Russ coaching from the sideline" style="object-position:50% 20%" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Executive presence</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573167507387-6b4b98cb7c13?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A leader running a meeting with a full table" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Leadership</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600880292203-757bb62b4baf?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Two colleagues high-fiving at a desk" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Communication</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1624295059100-0ca889087b54?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team huddled together, arms around each other" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Team trust</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552674605-db6ffd4facb5?w=1000&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Three runners training at dawn" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>High performance</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your coach</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Twenty years leading organizations and the people in them: a law practice, a housing nonprofit, a foundation board, and the teams behind each. He coaches leaders the way he wished someone had coached him.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/speaking/">About Russ</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2><p class="lede">Start with a free call.</p></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>The call</h3><p>Thirty minutes with Russ. What the company needs, who it is for, whether it fits.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The design</h3><p>We size it: one executive, a leadership team, or the whole organization. One price, in writing.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The season</h3><p>Three private sessions a month. Your team together. Russ with you until the work holds.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ctarow" style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start a conversation</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="after"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What changes</p><h2>When it is done.</h2></div>
      <div class="after"><div><b>Leaders say the hard thing.</b><p>Early, clearly, and without the blast radius.</p></div><div><b>Teams decide once.</b><p>The meeting after the meeting goes away.</p></div><div><b>Performance holds.</b><p>Because the habits are built, not borrowed.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Past · Present · Future</p><h2>Part of Vault Human.</h2><p class="lede">Triplicity means three held together: you, the people you answer to, and the people who answer to you. Triplicity is the executive leadership, communication and high-performance coaching company in the Vault Human family. Vault Human is daily coaching a person chooses for their own life. Triplicity is coaching for leaders and the teams around them.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Modernizes how your work runs: tools, workflows, AI. Not a coach. Not a law firm.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green me" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com"><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>Executive leadership, communication and high-performance coaching. Not a law firm.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet Law</h3><p>The law firm. Wills, trusts, probate and a plan for your family. Not coaching.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Triplicity do?</summary><p>Executive leadership, communication and high-performance coaching, for one leader or a whole team.</p></details><details><summary>How is this different from Vault Human?</summary><p>Vault Human is daily personal coaching you choose for yourself: a key each morning, a year walked chamber by chamber. Triplicity is executive leadership coaching for you and the people you lead. Same founder, different job.</p></details><details><summary>Who coaches?</summary><p>Russ Michaels leads every engagement. Larger organizations add Vault coaches he trains.</p></details><details><summary>Is this therapy?</summary><p>No. It's coaching. We are not therapists or doctors, and coaching is not therapy or medical care.</p></details><details><summary>How much time does it take?</summary><p>Three private hours a month with Russ, time with your team if you add one, and a few minutes each morning.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><img class="bgimg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515187029135-18ee286d815b?w=1800&q=72&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="A team in a workshop" loading="lazy" /><div class="veil"></div><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Put a coach in the room.</h2><p class="lede">A 30-minute call with Russ. Then you decide.</p>
      <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Start a conversation</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site">
    <div class="wrap foot">
      <div><a class="brand" href="/">Tri<b>plicity</b></a><p>Executive, leadership and team coaching.</p><p><a href="mailto:vault@vaulthuman.com">vault@vaulthuman.com</a> · <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p></div>
      <ul><li><a href="#who">Who it is for</a></li><li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li><li></li><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></li></ul>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen</li><li><a href="https://www.fretworksystems.com">Fretwork</a> — Learn · the past</li><li><a href="https://triplicityadvisory.com">Triplicity</a> — Love · the present</li><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> — Live · the future</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Triplicity Advisory. Coaching is not legal, medical, financial or therapeutic advice.</span><span>Part of the Vault Human family</span></div>
  </footer>

  <div id="vh-modal" class="vh-modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="vh-modal__bg" data-close-form></div>
    <div class="vh-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Start a conversation">
      <button class="vh-modal__x" type="button" data-close-form aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <h2 class="vh-modal__title">Start a conversation</h2>
      <div class="contact-panel" style="padding:28px 26px;border:1px solid rgba(139,146,153,.35);border-radius:12px;text-align:left"><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.75">Call</p><p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600"><a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a></p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;opacity:.8">Call and ask for Russ. If he's with someone, leave a message and he'll call you back.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
    <script is:inline>
  (function(){var m=document.getElementById('vh-modal');if(!m)return;
  function o(e){if(e)e.preventDefault();m.classList.add('is-open');m.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');document.documentElement.style.overflow='hidden';}
